#: ../content/index.rst:26
msgid "After installation and activating the system configuration, a dropdown is added to the possible values elements in the AdminDynamicFieldDB screen (see picture 2). There you can choose a header under which the possible value should be layouted. An example layout of the TicketInformation widget in AgentTicketZoom is shown in picture 1."
